        },
        {
          "text": "Khunyanga yeneyo olusaka lwOMWAMI lulalolekha obulayi, khandi okveing'oono; ebiamo bieshibala nabio bilaba ebilayi, nibibasangaasia abo abeehonokooshe mubaIsiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
